[00:20.36]Ever loyal to Jehovah,
[00:26.14]Loyal love we wish to show.
[00:32.70]As a people, dedicated,
[00:38.92]His commands we want to know.
[00:45.32]His advice will never fail us,
[00:51.54]And his counsel we obey.
[00:57.78]He is loyal; we can trust him.
[01:04.20]From his side we’ll never stray.
[01:20.22]Ever loyal to our brothers,
[01:25.02]Sticking close in times of need.
[01:32.48]Ever caring, always trusting,
[01:38.84]Ever kind in word and deed.
[01:45.00]We show honor to our brothers
[01:50.60]And respect them from the heart.
[01:57.68]Ever loyal, ever closer,
[02:04.00]From their side we’ll never part.
[02:10.98]Ever loyal to their guidance
[03:12.02]When our brothers lead the way.
[03:18.34]When they give us clear direction,
[03:24.66]May we loyally obey.
[03:31.00]Then the blessing from Jehovah
[03:36.04]Will be ours to make us strong.
[03:43.51]When we’re loyal, ever faithful,
[03:49.46]To Jehovah we’ll belong.
